TEXT -96 -288 Left 2 ;Problem 2.1 - graphical conversion.  Top: the sheet's circuit in the IMPEDANCE analogy (force = V, velocity = I, mass = L, compliance = C).
TEXT -96 -256 Left 2 ;Bottom: its dual in the MOBILITY analogy (velocity = V, force = I, mass = C, compliance = L, damper = 1/R).  Series <-> parallel, V <-> I.
